&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Space Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist the Office Manager with employee seating arrangements, desk allocations, and office layout planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate with onsite facility staff and address ad hoc projects directed by the IT, People (HR), and Finance teams as aligned with the Office Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎉 Culture &amp;amp; Employee Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural Stewardship:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a culture champion by supporting and executing various company events and engagement activities, making the office a place of positivity and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎓 Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum of&lt;strong&gt; 1 to 5&amp;nbsp;years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in office administration, facilities coordination, events or workplace operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Player:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working under the guidance of an Office Manager while taking independent ownership of daily floor tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable using Google Workspace (Docs, Sheets, Slides) and handling basic office AV/conferencing setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t wait to be told what to do—you anticipate floor needs and solve issues before they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; An eagle eye for organization, cleanliness, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent verbal and written communication skills with strong interpersonal savvy to interact with employees and vendors alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prioritization:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to self-manage, multitask, and prioritize your workflow effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Service &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong spirit of collaboration and a dedication to providing great internal customer service to all employees and visitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A vibrant, collaborative, and supportive work culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to shape the daily workplace experience of a growing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear mentorship and growth under an experienced Office Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
