&lt;p data-start=&quot;2710&quot; data-end=&quot;2788&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience selling AI, data, analytics, SaaS, or emerging tech into government&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
